<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank j. Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on CS Group shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    250 CHF		   PREMIUM	35.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.39 CHF (INDICATIVE) GEARING	10.2 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.JUL.97-15.APR.99   PAYDATE	14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  SPOT REF     199 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
